@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@categoryId = 1
@menuId = 1
@orderId = 1
@email = buyer@example.com
@date = 2026-11-03
@keyword = Brazil Serra Do Caparaó

### A06 전체 메뉴 목록 ->200
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus
Content-Type: application/json

###A07 메뉴 상세 -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/2

### A08 메뉴 등록 -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Americano",
  "price": 5000,
  "description": "테스트용입니다."
}

### A09 메뉴 일반 수정 -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menus/{{menuId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### A10 메뉴 삭제 -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menus/{{menuId}}

### A19 판매 중 메뉴 -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/available

### A20 메뉴명 검색 -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/search?keyword=={{keyword}}

### A21 판매 여부 변경 -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menus/{{menuId}}/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}

### A08 오류: 가격 범위 초과 → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Latte",
  "price": 99999999,
  "description": "테스트입니다."
}
